@startuml
[*] --> Ready
Ready -> Card Inserted : Insert Card
Card Inserted -> PIN Verified : Enter PIN (successful)
PIN Verified -> Options Displayed : Select Options
Options Displayed -> Withdrawal Processed : Approve Withdrawal
Withdrawal Processed -> Receipt Printed : Dispense Cash and Print Receipt
Receipt Printed -> Card Returned : Return Card
Card Returned --> Ready : Reset System (brief moment later)
@enduml
